[
  {
    "index": 0,
    "text": "[Gabby gasps]"
  },
  {
    "index": 1,
    "text": "♪ Meow, meow, meow, meow, meow ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 2,
    "text": "♪ Hey, Gabby ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 3,
    "text": "♪ Take us to the Dollhouse ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 4,
    "text": "♪ Hey, Gabby ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 5,
    "text": "♪ Little by little"
  },
  {
    "index": 6,
    "text": "Let's live in the meow ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 7,
    "text": "♪ Meow, meow, meow, meow, meow, meow ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 8,
    "text": "♪ Meow, meow, meow, meow, meow, meow ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 9,
    "text": "♪ Meow, meow, meow, meow, meow ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 10,
    "text": "-♪ Hey, Gabby ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 11,
    "text": "-♪ Meow, meow, meow, meow, meow ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 12,
    "text": "-♪ What's the big surprise? ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 13,
    "text": "-♪ Meow, meow ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 14,
    "text": "♪ Let's shrink right down and go inside ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 15,
    "text": "♪ Hey, Gabby ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 16,
    "text": "♪ Meow ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 17,
    "text": "Oh, hi! Want to see what I'm making?"
  },
  {
    "index": 18,
    "text": "-It's a cat-tastic new toy for Floyd."
  },
  {
    "index": 19,
    "text": "-[bells jingling]"
  },
  {
    "index": 20,
    "text": "Hmm. I think I'll add"
  },
  {
    "index": 21,
    "text": "just one more pom-pom. [giggles]"
  },
  {
    "index": 22,
    "text": "Right here."
  },
  {
    "index": 23,
    "text": "And there."
  },
  {
    "index": 24,
    "text": "Do you think he'll like it? Let's go see!"
  },
  {
    "index": 25,
    "text": "Oh, Floyd, I have a surprise for you."
  },
  {
    "index": 26,
    "text": "[inhales deeply] Ta-da! What do you think?"
  },
  {
    "index": 27,
    "text": "[gasps] Ooh! I think he likes it."
  },
  {
    "index": 28,
    "text": "-♪ Meow, meow, meow ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 29,
    "text": "-Oh! You know what that sound means."
  },
  {
    "index": 30,
    "text": "It's time for a Dollhouse Delivery."
  },
  {
    "index": 31,
    "text": "Come on!"
  },
  {
    "index": 32,
    "text": "♪ Meow, meow, meow ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 33,
    "text": "♪ Meow ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 34,
    "text": "♪ Meow ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 35,
    "text": "♪ Meow ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 36,
    "text": "Hey, Pandy."
  },
  {
    "index": 37,
    "text": "All right. Let's see what our"
  },
  {
    "index": 38,
    "text": "Meow Meow Mailbox has for us today."
  },
  {
    "index": 39,
    "text": "Hey, this Kitty Cat Surprise Box"
  },
  {
    "index": 40,
    "text": "looks like someone we know."
  },
  {
    "index": 41,
    "text": "Who does this look like?"
  },
  {
    "index": 42,
    "text": "CatRat!"
  },
  {
    "index": 43,
    "text": "Ha-cha!"
  },
  {
    "index": 44,
    "text": "Should we open it up"
  },
  {
    "index": 45,
    "text": "and see what's inside?"
  },
  {
    "index": 46,
    "text": "Of course we should."
  },
  {
    "index": 47,
    "text": "[gasps] Ooh!"
  },
  {
    "index": 48,
    "text": "It's a present... for CatRat."
  },
  {
    "index": 49,
    "text": "It says,"
  },
  {
    "index": 50,
    "text": "\"This is a very special birthday delivery"
  },
  {
    "index": 51,
    "text": "for an amazing, stupendous,"
  },
  {
    "index": 52,
    "text": "spectacularly funny CatRat!\""
  },
  {
    "index": 53,
    "text": "Today is CatRat's birthday!"
  },
  {
    "index": 54,
    "text": "Aww!"
  },
  {
    "index": 55,
    "text": "We should do something special for him,"
  },
  {
    "index": 56,
    "text": "like a surprise party."
  },
  {
    "index": 57,
    "text": "We'll have to have a surprise cake,"
  },
  {
    "index": 58,
    "text": "some surprise decorations..."
  },
  {
    "index": 59,
    "text": "[gasps] Ooh. And I know."
  },
  {
    "index": 60,
    "text": "A super-surprise guest."
  },
  {
    "index": 61,
    "text": "Let's invite"
  },
  {
    "index": 62,
    "text": "CatRat's favorite rockstar kitty."
  },
  {
    "index": 63,
    "text": "Fluffy Flufferton!"
  },
  {
    "index": 64,
    "text": "Hey, Fluffy."
  },
  {
    "index": 65,
    "text": "Hey, Gabby. What's goin' on?"
  },
  {
    "index": 66,
    "text": "We're planning a surprise party"
  },
  {
    "index": 67,
    "text": "for your number-one fan."
  },
  {
    "index": 68,
    "text": "-CatRat?"
  },
  {
    "index": 69,
    "text": "-That's the birthday cat."
  },
  {
    "index": 70,
    "text": "Think you could make it?"
  },
  {
    "index": 71,
    "text": "CatRat's birthday?"
  },
  {
    "index": 72,
    "text": "I wouldn't miss it for the world!"
  },
  {
    "index": 73,
    "text": "I'll see you soon."
  },
  {
    "index": 74,
    "text": "Great! Thanks, Fluffy."
  },
  {
    "index": 75,
    "text": "CatRat is going to be so excited!"
  },
  {
    "index": 76,
    "text": "Eee!"
  },
  {
    "index": 77,
    "text": "Do you want to come to CatRat's"
  },
  {
    "index": 78,
    "text": "birthday party in the Dollhouse with us?"
  },
  {
    "index": 79,
    "text": "Great."
  },
  {
    "index": 80,
    "text": "I'll just put his present in my backpack,"
  },
  {
    "index": 81,
    "text": "and then close it up."
  },
  {
    "index": 82,
    "text": "Now it's time to get tiny."
  },
  {
    "index": 83,
    "text": "♪ A pinch on my left"
  },
  {
    "index": 84,
    "text": "Pinch, pinch on my right ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 85,
    "text": "♪ Grab Pandy's hand and hold on tight! ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 86,
    "text": "We're in the kitchen. Come on in!"
  },
  {
    "index": 87,
    "text": "Welcome to the Dollhouse."
  },
  {
    "index": 88,
    "text": "Now, let's see if we can find Pandy."
  },
  {
    "index": 89,
    "text": "Do you see him?"
  },
  {
    "index": 90,
    "text": "[chuckles] Kitchen hug attack!"
  },
  {
    "index": 91,
    "text": "Oof!"
  },
  {
    "index": 92,
    "text": "[both laugh]"
  },
  {
    "index": 93,
    "text": "Well, Pandy, you definitely cooked up"
  },
  {
    "index": 94,
    "text": "a great hug attack this time."
  },
  {
    "index": 95,
    "text": "Hi, everyone."
  },
  {
    "index": 96,
    "text": "-Hi, Cakey."
  },
  {
    "index": 97,
    "text": "-What brings you to the kitchen?"
  },
  {
    "index": 98,
    "text": "-Guess what today is."
  },
  {
    "index": 99,
    "text": "-What?"
  },
  {
    "index": 100,
    "text": "It's CatRat's birthday!"
  },
  {
    "index": 101,
    "text": "CatRat's birthday?"
  },
  {
    "index": 102,
    "text": "Yep. And we're going to throw him"
  },
  {
    "index": 103,
    "text": "a super-surprise birthday party."
  },
  {
    "index": 104,
    "text": "And the first thing we need"
  },
  {
    "index": 105,
    "text": "is a super-surprise cake."
  },
  {
    "index": 106,
    "text": "Ooh! I know just the thing."
  },
  {
    "index": 107,
    "text": "A sardine upside-down cake."
  },
  {
    "index": 108,
    "text": "Sardine upside-down cake?"
  },
  {
    "index": 109,
    "text": "-Yep. It's CatRat's favorite."
  },
  {
    "index": 110,
    "text": "-[Gabby laughs]"
  },
  {
    "index": 111,
    "text": "It's delicious and..."
  },
  {
    "index": 112,
    "text": "defishious!"
  },
  {
    "index": 113,
    "text": "Time for the cake pans."
  },
  {
    "index": 114,
    "text": "-[pans clatter]"
  },
  {
    "index": 115,
    "text": "-[giggles]"
  },
  {
    "index": 116,
    "text": "Okay, let's get bakin'."
  },
  {
    "index": 117,
    "text": "Let's bakey with Cakey!"
  },
  {
    "index": 118,
    "text": "And now, the most important part"
  },
  {
    "index": 119,
    "text": "of an upside-down cake is"
  },
  {
    "index": 120,
    "text": "you have to bake it"
  },
  {
    "index": 121,
    "text": "upside down!"
  },
  {
    "index": 122,
    "text": "-Yeah!"
  },
  {
    "index": 123,
    "text": "-Whoa!"
  },
  {
    "index": 124,
    "text": "Check it out."
  },
  {
    "index": 125,
    "text": "We're upside down."
  },
  {
    "index": 126,
    "text": "Yep. And we get to stay like this"
  },
  {
    "index": 127,
    "text": "until the cake is done."
  },
  {
    "index": 128,
    "text": "I don't know about you,"
  },
  {
    "index": 129,
    "text": "but all this upside-downing"
  },
  {
    "index": 130,
    "text": "is making me a little hungry."
  },
  {
    "index": 131,
    "text": "Mm!"
  },
  {
    "index": 132,
    "text": "-A banana."
  },
  {
    "index": 133,
    "text": "-[banana splats]"
  },
  {
    "index": 134,
    "text": "Hmm. That didn't work."
  },
  {
    "index": 135,
    "text": "Maybe I'll just have"
  },
  {
    "index": 136,
    "text": "some pretzels instead."
  },
  {
    "index": 137,
    "text": "[pretzels rustle]"
  },
  {
    "index": 138,
    "text": "Um... Okay."
  },
  {
    "index": 139,
    "text": "I guess I'll just have"
  },
  {
    "index": 140,
    "text": "a nice glass of water."
  },
  {
    "index": 141,
    "text": "Oh, furballs!"
  },
  {
    "index": 142,
    "text": "Sorry about the mess, Cakey."
  },
  {
    "index": 143,
    "text": "It's okay."
  },
  {
    "index": 144,
    "text": "Upside down can be messy."
  },
  {
    "index": 145,
    "text": "-[bell dings]"
  },
  {
    "index": 146,
    "text": "-Cake's done!"
  },
  {
    "index": 147,
    "text": "-Whoa!"
  },
  {
    "index": 148,
    "text": "-[laughs] Whee!"
  },
  {
    "index": 149,
    "text": "My snacks!"
  },
  {
    "index": 150,
    "text": "[gulps]"
  },
  {
    "index": 151,
    "text": "[munches, slurps]"
  },
  {
    "index": 152,
    "text": "Ah. Snacking is definitely better"
  },
  {
    "index": 153,
    "text": "right side..."
  },
  {
    "index": 154,
    "text": "Argh! Oof!"
  },
  {
    "index": 155,
    "text": "Whoopsies!"
  },
  {
    "index": 156,
    "text": "[Gabby and Cakey laugh]"
  },
  {
    "index": 157,
    "text": "♪ Stack 'em up, stack 'em up ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 158,
    "text": "♪ Mm-mm! ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 159,
    "text": "♪ Stack 'em up, stack 'em up ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 160,
    "text": "Now we get to decorate."
  },
  {
    "index": 161,
    "text": "[all] Yeah!"
  },
  {
    "index": 162,
    "text": "Ooh! We should decorate it"
  },
  {
    "index": 163,
    "text": "to look like CatRat's favorite thing."
  },
  {
    "index": 164,
    "text": "[all] CatRat!"
  },
  {
    "index": 165,
    "text": "[Gabby laughs]"
  },
  {
    "index": 166,
    "text": "You got it!"
  },
  {
    "index": 167,
    "text": "I've got all the frosting colors"
  },
  {
    "index": 168,
    "text": "we need right here."
  },
  {
    "index": 169,
    "text": "Wow! CatRat blue!"
  },
  {
    "index": 170,
    "text": "Tasty."
  },
  {
    "index": 171,
    "text": "Let's get to frosting."
  },
  {
    "index": 172,
    "text": "♪ Frost the cake, frost the cake ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 173,
    "text": "♪ CatRat blue, the perfect shade ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 174,
    "text": "♪ Frost the cake, frost the cake ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 175,
    "text": "♪ A sweet pink nose for CatRat's face ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 176,
    "text": "♪ Frost the cake, frost the cake ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 177,
    "text": "♪ Can't forget a birthday smile ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 178,
    "text": "♪ Yum! ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 179,
    "text": "Well? What do you think?"
  },
  {
    "index": 180,
    "text": "It's CatRat's face all right,"
  },
  {
    "index": 181,
    "text": "but I think we're missing something."
  },
  {
    "index": 182,
    "text": "Can you figure out what we're missing?"
  },
  {
    "index": 183,
    "text": "The ears!"
  },
  {
    "index": 184,
    "text": "Oh, sprinkles!"
  },
  {
    "index": 185,
    "text": "He definitely needs some ears."
  },
  {
    "index": 186,
    "text": "I've got it!"
  },
  {
    "index": 187,
    "text": "Sardine ears."
  },
  {
    "index": 188,
    "text": "And I'll frost 'em blue."
  },
  {
    "index": 189,
    "text": "I think CatRat"
  },
  {
    "index": 190,
    "text": "is really going to love this cake."
  },
  {
    "index": 191,
    "text": "[CatRat] Hmm? [sniffs] Do I smell cake?"
  },
  {
    "index": 192,
    "text": "[gasps] That sounds like CatRat."
  },
  {
    "index": 193,
    "text": "-[Gabby] Do you see CatRat?"
  },
  {
    "index": 194,
    "text": "-[bell dings]"
  },
  {
    "index": 195,
    "text": "He's in the Cat-A-Vator?"
  },
  {
    "index": 196,
    "text": "-Quick, hide the cake!"
  },
  {
    "index": 197,
    "text": "-And the baking stuff!"
  },
  {
    "index": 198,
    "text": "-Whoa!"
  },
  {
    "index": 199,
    "text": "-[splat]"
  },
  {
    "index": 200,
    "text": "[laughs] Whoopsie!"
  },
  {
    "index": 201,
    "text": "Whoa!"
  },
  {
    "index": 202,
    "text": "[both] Phew!"
  },
  {
    "index": 203,
    "text": "Wait. Where's Cakey?"
  },
  {
    "index": 204,
    "text": "-[Cakey] I'm in here!"
  },
  {
    "index": 205,
    "text": "-[both gasp]"
  },
  {
    "index": 206,
    "text": "Hi there."
  },
  {
    "index": 207,
    "text": "Sorry, Cakey."
  },
  {
    "index": 208,
    "text": "I'm okay. Did we get everything?"
  },
  {
    "index": 209,
    "text": "[all gasp]"
  },
  {
    "index": 210,
    "text": "[bell dings]"
  },
  {
    "index": 211,
    "text": "[CatRat whistling \"Happy Birthday\"]"
  },
  {
    "index": 212,
    "text": "[Pandy gulps]"
  },
  {
    "index": 213,
    "text": "Why, hello, CatRat."
  },
  {
    "index": 214,
    "text": "What brings you to the kitchen?"
  },
  {
    "index": 215,
    "text": "Well, I was strollin'"
  },
  {
    "index": 216,
    "text": "through the Dollhouse"
  },
  {
    "index": 217,
    "text": "and thought I smelled something..."
  },
  {
    "index": 218,
    "text": "birthday cake-y?"
  },
  {
    "index": 219,
    "text": "Oh, it must have been this, uh, banana."
  },
  {
    "index": 220,
    "text": "Mm! Smells so sweet."
  },
  {
    "index": 221,
    "text": "I don't think that was it."
  },
  {
    "index": 222,
    "text": "Oh, hey. By the way, do you guys know"
  },
  {
    "index": 223,
    "text": "what special day it is today?"
  },
  {
    "index": 224,
    "text": "Hmm?"
  },
  {
    "index": 225,
    "text": "-Special day?"
  },
  {
    "index": 226,
    "text": "-Oh, yeah."
  },
  {
    "index": 227,
    "text": "-Totally. It's, uh..."
  },
  {
    "index": 228,
    "text": "-Uh..."
  },
  {
    "index": 229,
    "text": "National Hug-a-Cat Day!"
  },
  {
    "index": 230,
    "text": "[Pandy] Right."
  },
  {
    "index": 231,
    "text": "I see."
  },
  {
    "index": 232,
    "text": "Well, now that I got my hug,"
  },
  {
    "index": 233,
    "text": "I guess there's nothing else"
  },
  {
    "index": 234,
    "text": "to celebrate. [chuckles]"
  },
  {
    "index": 235,
    "text": "Certainly not a birthday or anything."
  },
  {
    "index": 236,
    "text": "Hmm."
  },
  {
    "index": 237,
    "text": "I guess I'll be on my way, then."
  },
  {
    "index": 238,
    "text": "-[Gabby] See you later, CatRat!"
  },
  {
    "index": 239,
    "text": "-[Pandy] Bye!"
  },
  {
    "index": 240,
    "text": "Phew! That was a close one."
  },
  {
    "index": 241,
    "text": "It sure was."
  },
  {
    "index": 242,
    "text": "I'm just glad"
  },
  {
    "index": 243,
    "text": "we didn't spoil CatRat's surprise."
  },
  {
    "index": 244,
    "text": "Cakey, can you keep this cake out of sight"
  },
  {
    "index": 245,
    "text": "until Fluffy Flufferton gets here?"
  },
  {
    "index": 246,
    "text": "No problem."
  },
  {
    "index": 247,
    "text": "Wait. Fluffy Flufferton is coming? [gasps]"
  },
  {
    "index": 248,
    "text": "Yep. She's gonna sing a special"
  },
  {
    "index": 249,
    "text": "birthday song for CatRat with DJ Catnip."
  },
  {
    "index": 250,
    "text": "[Cakey squeals]"
  },
  {
    "index": 251,
    "text": "This party is going to be sprinkle-riffic!"
  },
  {
    "index": 252,
    "text": "Okay, we've still got a lot to do"
  },
  {
    "index": 253,
    "text": "to get ready for the party."
  },
  {
    "index": 254,
    "text": "We'd better go see Baby Box"
  },
  {
    "index": 255,
    "text": "about some decorations."
  },
  {
    "index": 256,
    "text": "To the craft room! Bye, Cakey."
  },
  {
    "index": 257,
    "text": "Good luck. Cakey's rootin' for you."
  },
  {
    "index": 258,
    "text": "[bell dings]"
  },
  {
    "index": 259,
    "text": "-[bell dings]"
  },
  {
    "index": 260,
    "text": "-Just one more cup."
  },
  {
    "index": 261,
    "text": "And..."
  },
  {
    "index": 262,
    "text": "there!"
  },
  {
    "index": 263,
    "text": "[bell dings]"
  },
  {
    "index": 264,
    "text": "-[both] Baby Box!"
  },
  {
    "index": 265,
    "text": "-Whoa!"
  },
  {
    "index": 266,
    "text": "Doodles and doo-dads!"
  },
  {
    "index": 267,
    "text": "You really surprised me."
  },
  {
    "index": 268,
    "text": "-Whoopsie!"
  },
  {
    "index": 269,
    "text": "-Sorry about that, Baby Box."
  },
  {
    "index": 270,
    "text": "We're in a super craft-y-riffic hurry,"
  },
  {
    "index": 271,
    "text": "'cause we need to get our special"
  },
  {
    "index": 272,
    "text": "birthday surprise ready for CatRat."
  },
  {
    "index": 273,
    "text": "Today is CatRat's birthday?"
  },
  {
    "index": 274,
    "text": "[Box Brothers] CatRat's birthday?"
  },
  {
    "index": 275,
    "text": "We'd love to help. What do you need?"
  },
  {
    "index": 276,
    "text": "-Decorations?"
  },
  {
    "index": 277,
    "text": "-Or a present?"
  },
  {
    "index": 278,
    "text": "We need decorations and a present."
  },
  {
    "index": 279,
    "text": "I have an idea."
  },
  {
    "index": 280,
    "text": "We'll make the present."
  },
  {
    "index": 281,
    "text": "And we'll make the decorations."
  },
  {
    "index": 282,
    "text": "How about some nifty"
  },
  {
    "index": 283,
    "text": "paper-cup string lights?"
  },
  {
    "index": 284,
    "text": "Oh! I think CatRat will love that."
  },
  {
    "index": 285,
    "text": "Alrighty!"
  },
  {
    "index": 286,
    "text": "We're on it!"
  },
  {
    "index": 287,
    "text": "See you soon!"
  },
  {
    "index": 288,
    "text": "Thanks, Box Brothers."
  },
  {
    "index": 289,
    "text": "So, for CatRat's present,"
  },
  {
    "index": 290,
    "text": "we need something that's gonna make him"
  },
  {
    "index": 291,
    "text": "feel super special on his birthday."
  },
  {
    "index": 292,
    "text": "And it's got to be shiny,"
  },
  {
    "index": 293,
    "text": "because CatRat loves shiny things."
  },
  {
    "index": 294,
    "text": "Hmm. What about..."
  },
  {
    "index": 295,
    "text": "a shiny tinfoil birthday crown?"
  },
  {
    "index": 296,
    "text": "Oh! CatRat can be king for the day."
  },
  {
    "index": 297,
    "text": "He'll definitely love that."
  },
  {
    "index": 298,
    "text": "Then... let's get crafting!"
  },
  {
    "index": 299,
    "text": "Whee!"
  },
  {
    "index": 300,
    "text": "We can make the crown"
  },
  {
    "index": 301,
    "text": "out of cardboard. Cutty-cutty!"
  },
  {
    "index": 302,
    "text": "We need to make"
  },
  {
    "index": 303,
    "text": "a lot of pointy peaks on the top,"
  },
  {
    "index": 304,
    "text": "like this."
  },
  {
    "index": 305,
    "text": "And to make it shiny,"
  },
  {
    "index": 306,
    "text": "we're going to wrap the crown"
  },
  {
    "index": 307,
    "text": "in some tinfoil."
  },
  {
    "index": 308,
    "text": "Wow! This is shiny."
  },
  {
    "index": 309,
    "text": "I can see myself. Ah!"
  },
  {
    "index": 310,
    "text": "There. Now we get to decorate it."
  },
  {
    "index": 311,
    "text": "Let's add some of these sparkly gems."
  },
  {
    "index": 312,
    "text": "Just need some trusty glue."
  },
  {
    "index": 313,
    "text": "[glue bottle squelching]"
  },
  {
    "index": 314,
    "text": "Now, just tape the ends together, and..."
  },
  {
    "index": 315,
    "text": "you've got yourself a crown."
  },
  {
    "index": 316,
    "text": "And to make it super special for CatRat..."
  },
  {
    "index": 317,
    "text": "Ha-cha!"
  },
  {
    "index": 318,
    "text": "...add some mini CatRats on top."
  },
  {
    "index": 319,
    "text": "Ta-da!"
  },
  {
    "index": 320,
    "text": "Now, that is one"
  },
  {
    "index": 321,
    "text": "CatRat-tastic birthday crown."
  },
  {
    "index": 322,
    "text": "Thanks. Do you think CatRat will like it?"
  },
  {
    "index": 323,
    "text": "I have a feeling he's gonna love it."
  },
  {
    "index": 324,
    "text": "Okay."
  },
  {
    "index": 325,
    "text": "So, we've got the cake,"
  },
  {
    "index": 326,
    "text": "we've got the present."
  },
  {
    "index": 327,
    "text": "Wahoo! And the decorations."
  },
  {
    "index": 328,
    "text": "Whoa!"
  },
  {
    "index": 329,
    "text": "And check."
  },
  {
    "index": 330,
    "text": "We even added little sardines"
  },
  {
    "index": 331,
    "text": "on the bottom just for CatRat."
  },
  {
    "index": 332,
    "text": "CatRat does love his sardines."
  },
  {
    "index": 333,
    "text": "-[CatRat humming \"Happy Birthday\"]"
  },
  {
    "index": 334,
    "text": "-CatRat's coming! Quick, hide the crown!"
  },
  {
    "index": 335,
    "text": "-And the lights!"
  },
  {
    "index": 336,
    "text": "-And the craft items!"
  },
  {
    "index": 337,
    "text": "Whoa!"
  },
  {
    "index": 338,
    "text": "Phew!"
  },
  {
    "index": 339,
    "text": "-Wait. Where's Baby Box?"
  },
  {
    "index": 340,
    "text": "-[Baby Box giggles]"
  },
  {
    "index": 341,
    "text": "[Pandy gasps]"
  },
  {
    "index": 342,
    "text": "Here I am."
  },
  {
    "index": 343,
    "text": "-Sorry about that, Baby Box."
  },
  {
    "index": 344,
    "text": "-[Baby Box giggles]"
  },
  {
    "index": 345,
    "text": "[bell dings]"
  },
  {
    "index": 346,
    "text": "Well, hello again."
  },
  {
    "index": 347,
    "text": "It's just me,"
  },
  {
    "index": 348,
    "text": "your ol' pal CatRat passin' through."
  },
  {
    "index": 349,
    "text": "-♪ Doo-doo-doo, doo-doo-doo-doo ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 350,
    "text": "-Oh."
  },
  {
    "index": 351,
    "text": "Looks like someone's been doing"
  },
  {
    "index": 352,
    "text": "a little crafting."
  },
  {
    "index": 353,
    "text": "Making something special"
  },
  {
    "index": 354,
    "text": "for anyone I know, hmm?"
  },
  {
    "index": 355,
    "text": "Um... Nope. No crafting around here."
  },
  {
    "index": 356,
    "text": "We actually came here to, uh, celebrate."
  },
  {
    "index": 357,
    "text": "-[gasps] Celebrate?"
  },
  {
    "index": 358,
    "text": "-That's right."
  },
  {
    "index": 359,
    "text": "We were celebrating"
  },
  {
    "index": 360,
    "text": "National... Cutty-Cutty Day."
  },
  {
    "index": 361,
    "text": "-[snipping]"
  },
  {
    "index": 362,
    "text": "-Cutty-cutty!"
  },
  {
    "index": 363,
    "text": "It's my favorite."
  },
  {
    "index": 364,
    "text": "You mean to tell me that today"
  },
  {
    "index": 365,
    "text": "is National Hug-a-Cat Day"
  },
  {
    "index": 366,
    "text": "and National Cutty-Cutty Day?"
  },
  {
    "index": 367,
    "text": "-Uh-huh."
  },
  {
    "index": 368,
    "text": "-Totally."
  },
  {
    "index": 369,
    "text": "It's a big day."
  },
  {
    "index": 370,
    "text": "Huh."
  },
  {
    "index": 371,
    "text": "[sighs] I think I'm gonna go take a nap."
  },
  {
    "index": 372,
    "text": "-Bye, CatRat."
  },
  {
    "index": 373,
    "text": "-Enjoy your nap."
  },
  {
    "index": 374,
    "text": "[sighs]"
  },
  {
    "index": 375,
    "text": "Aww! I don't think we can keep"
  },
  {
    "index": 376,
    "text": "this surprise party a secret much longer."
  },
  {
    "index": 377,
    "text": "We've got to make sure CatRat knows"
  },
  {
    "index": 378,
    "text": "we didn't forget his birthday."
  },
  {
    "index": 379,
    "text": "-[gasps]"
  },
  {
    "index": 380,
    "text": "-[phone chiming and buzzing]"
  },
  {
    "index": 381,
    "text": "It's Fluffy!"
  },
  {
    "index": 382,
    "text": "-Hey, Fluffy."
  },
  {
    "index": 383,
    "text": "-Hey, Gabby."
  },
  {
    "index": 384,
    "text": "I'm here in the music room with DJ Catnip."
  },
  {
    "index": 385,
    "text": "We're working on"
  },
  {
    "index": 386,
    "text": "our special birthday song for CatRat,"
  },
  {
    "index": 387,
    "text": "but we're having a little trouble"
  },
  {
    "index": 388,
    "text": "with the words."
  },
  {
    "index": 389,
    "text": "We could really use some help."
  },
  {
    "index": 390,
    "text": "Don't give up, you two. We're on our way."
  },
  {
    "index": 391,
    "text": "We need to get"
  },
  {
    "index": 392,
    "text": "to the music room, and fast."
  },
  {
    "index": 393,
    "text": "The Box Brothers and I will meet you there"
  },
  {
    "index": 394,
    "text": "with the present and the decorations."
  },
  {
    "index": 395,
    "text": "Thanks, Baby Box."
  },
  {
    "index": 396,
    "text": "See you soon."
  },
  {
    "index": 397,
    "text": "Oh, okay, I'll just tell you."
  },
  {
    "index": 398,
    "text": "It's my birthday!"
  },
  {
    "index": 399,
    "text": "Guys?"
  },
  {
    "index": 400,
    "text": "Guys?"
  },
  {
    "index": 401,
    "text": "Aww."
  },
  {
    "index": 402,
    "text": "I can't believe"
  },
  {
    "index": 403,
    "text": "no one remembered my birthday."
  },
  {
    "index": 404,
    "text": "[sighs]"
  },
  {
    "index": 405,
    "text": "[bell dings]"
  },
  {
    "index": 406,
    "text": "[bell dings]"
  },
  {
    "index": 407,
    "text": "-Hey, DJ."
  },
  {
    "index": 408,
    "text": "-Fluffy!"
  },
  {
    "index": 409,
    "text": "Oh, boy, are we glad to see you!"
  },
  {
    "index": 410,
    "text": "What seems to be the problem?"
  },
  {
    "index": 411,
    "text": "Well, we've got a great beat"
  },
  {
    "index": 412,
    "text": "for CatRat's song,"
  },
  {
    "index": 413,
    "text": "but we're having trouble with the words."
  },
  {
    "index": 414,
    "text": "They don't rhyme!"
  },
  {
    "index": 415,
    "text": "They don't rhyme yet."
  },
  {
    "index": 416,
    "text": "But I bet we can come up with"
  },
  {
    "index": 417,
    "text": "some rhyming words if we work together."
  },
  {
    "index": 418,
    "text": "All right, now. Give a listen."
  },
  {
    "index": 419,
    "text": "From the top, Fluffy."
  },
  {
    "index": 420,
    "text": "[music playing]"
  },
  {
    "index": 421,
    "text": "♪ Your friends are here to say surprise ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 422,
    "text": "♪ Jumpin' out before your ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 423,
    "text": "Nose? Aww..."
  },
  {
    "index": 424,
    "text": "See what we mean?"
  },
  {
    "index": 425,
    "text": "We need a word that rhymes with surprise."
  },
  {
    "index": 426,
    "text": "Okay. We can figure this out."
  },
  {
    "index": 427,
    "text": "Yeah. Play it one more time."
  },
  {
    "index": 428,
    "text": "[music playing]"
  },
  {
    "index": 429,
    "text": "♪ Your friends are here to say surprise ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 430,
    "text": "♪ Jumpin' out before your ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 431,
    "text": "-Eyes!"
  },
  {
    "index": 432,
    "text": "-Face!"
  },
  {
    "index": 433,
    "text": "Hmm. Which word rhymes with surprise?"
  },
  {
    "index": 434,
    "text": "Eyes or face?"
  },
  {
    "index": 435,
    "text": "Eyes!"
  },
  {
    "index": 436,
    "text": "Surprise and eyes! Great rhyming!"
  },
  {
    "index": 437,
    "text": "Let's skip to the cake part."
  },
  {
    "index": 438,
    "text": "Okay. Ready?"
  },
  {
    "index": 439,
    "text": "[music playing]"
  },
  {
    "index": 440,
    "text": "♪ Your birthday cake smells so nice ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 441,
    "text": "♪ Grab a plate and grab a ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 442,
    "text": "Spoon!"
  },
  {
    "index": 443,
    "text": "Slice!"
  },
  {
    "index": 444,
    "text": "Which word rhymes with nice?"
  },
  {
    "index": 445,
    "text": "Spoon or slice?"
  },
  {
    "index": 446,
    "text": "Slice!"
  },
  {
    "index": 447,
    "text": "That's perfect!"
  },
  {
    "index": 448,
    "text": "Nice and slice!"
  },
  {
    "index": 449,
    "text": "We just need one more rhyme. Ready?"
  },
  {
    "index": 450,
    "text": "♪ We've got gifts and decorations too ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 451,
    "text": "♪ We made them special just for, uh ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 452,
    "text": "-Today!"
  },
  {
    "index": 453,
    "text": "-You!"
  },
  {
    "index": 454,
    "text": "Fun!"
  },
  {
    "index": 455,
    "text": "Which word rhymes with too?"
  },
  {
    "index": 456,
    "text": "Today, you, or fun?"
  },
  {
    "index": 457,
    "text": "You!"
  },
  {
    "index": 458,
    "text": "Too and you! Ha-ha!"
  },
  {
    "index": 459,
    "text": "-Now our song totally rhymes."
  },
  {
    "index": 460,
    "text": "-Thanks for all your help."
  },
  {
    "index": 461,
    "text": "Birthday song, check."
  },
  {
    "index": 462,
    "text": "Now we're ready to party, CatRat-style."
  },
  {
    "index": 463,
    "text": "[bell dings]"
  },
  {
    "index": 464,
    "text": "Come on, everybody."
  },
  {
    "index": 465,
    "text": "It's party time!"
  },
  {
    "index": 466,
    "text": "-Everybody's here!"
  },
  {
    "index": 467,
    "text": "-[party horn honks]"
  },
  {
    "index": 468,
    "text": "-I love a good surprise party."
  },
  {
    "index": 469,
    "text": "-Yeah!"
  },
  {
    "index": 470,
    "text": "-Wahoo!"
  },
  {
    "index": 471,
    "text": "-Wahoo!"
  },
  {
    "index": 472,
    "text": "-Beep, beep!"
  },
  {
    "index": 473,
    "text": "-[giggles] So excited!"
  },
  {
    "index": 474,
    "text": "[party horn honks]"
  },
  {
    "index": 475,
    "text": "Whoa!"
  },
  {
    "index": 476,
    "text": "The room looks a-meow-zing!"
  },
  {
    "index": 477,
    "text": "Now all we need is the birthday cat."
  },
  {
    "index": 478,
    "text": "I'm on it."
  },
  {
    "index": 479,
    "text": "[over megaphone]"
  },
  {
    "index": 480,
    "text": "Calling CatRat! Calling CatRat!"
  },
  {
    "index": 481,
    "text": "Please report to the music room!"
  },
  {
    "index": 482,
    "text": "I'm comin', I'm comin'!"
  },
  {
    "index": 483,
    "text": "Quick, everybody hide!"
  },
  {
    "index": 484,
    "text": "I gotta hide!"
  },
  {
    "index": 485,
    "text": "-Quick, he's comin'!"
  },
  {
    "index": 486,
    "text": "-[Baby Box] Hiding!"
  },
  {
    "index": 487,
    "text": "When you see CatRat, yell, \"Surprise!\""
  },
  {
    "index": 488,
    "text": "[bell dings]"
  },
  {
    "index": 489,
    "text": "[all] Surprise!"
  },
  {
    "index": 490,
    "text": "Whoa-ho-ho!"
  },
  {
    "index": 491,
    "text": "A surprise party?"
  },
  {
    "index": 492,
    "text": "[gasps] For me?"
  },
  {
    "index": 493,
    "text": "Happy Birthday, CatRat!"
  },
  {
    "index": 494,
    "text": "Oh!"
  },
  {
    "index": 495,
    "text": "I thought everyone forgot my birthday."
  },
  {
    "index": 496,
    "text": "Oh, CatRat."
  },
  {
    "index": 497,
    "text": "We could never forget about you."
  },
  {
    "index": 498,
    "text": "Happy Birthday, CatRat."
  },
  {
    "index": 499,
    "text": "-Here's your birthday crown."
  },
  {
    "index": 500,
    "text": "-[CatRat gasps]"
  },
  {
    "index": 501,
    "text": "It's shiny and it's miney?"
  },
  {
    "index": 502,
    "text": "I love it!"
  },
  {
    "index": 503,
    "text": "Happy Birthday, CatRat."
  },
  {
    "index": 504,
    "text": "[gasps] Hello, handsome cake! [chuckles]"
  },
  {
    "index": 505,
    "text": "And wait till you hear this one, buddy."
  },
  {
    "index": 506,
    "text": "A special birthday song, made with love!"
  },
  {
    "index": 507,
    "text": "Hit it!"
  },
  {
    "index": 508,
    "text": "[music playing]"
  },
  {
    "index": 509,
    "text": "[CatRat] Is... Is that..."
  },
  {
    "index": 510,
    "text": "Fluffy Flufferton?"
  },
  {
    "index": 511,
    "text": "Hi, Fluffy! [giggles]"
  },
  {
    "index": 512,
    "text": "Happy Birthday, CatRat."
  },
  {
    "index": 513,
    "text": "This one goes out"
  },
  {
    "index": 514,
    "text": "to the one and only CatRat!"
  },
  {
    "index": 515,
    "text": "♪ Happy Birthday, dear CatRat ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 516,
    "text": "♪ We're making sure"
  },
  {
    "index": 517,
    "text": "That your day is all that it can be ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 518,
    "text": "[melody plays]"
  },
  {
    "index": 519,
    "text": "♪ You'll see ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 520,
    "text": "Come on!"
  },
  {
    "index": 521,
    "text": "-♪ Who's the cat we all adore? ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 522,
    "text": "-♪ CatRat! ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 523,
    "text": "♪ Who makes us laugh, pops out of doors? ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 524,
    "text": "-♪ CatRat! ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 525,
    "text": "-♪ So sly, so dry, he hates to get wet ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 526,
    "text": "♪ He's as cute as a kitty can get"
  },
  {
    "index": 527,
    "text": "Sing it! ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 528,
    "text": "♪ Happy Birthday, dear CatRat ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 529,
    "text": "♪ We're making sure"
  },
  {
    "index": 530,
    "text": "That your day is all that it can be ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 531,
    "text": "[melody plays]"
  },
  {
    "index": 532,
    "text": "♪ You'll see ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 533,
    "text": "[party horn honks]"
  },
  {
    "index": 534,
    "text": "♪ Your friends are here before your eyes ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 535,
    "text": "-♪ Jumping out to say surprise ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 536,
    "text": "-[party horns honk]"
  },
  {
    "index": 537,
    "text": "♪ And the cake, it smells so nice ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 538,
    "text": "♪ Grab a fork and grab a slice ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 539,
    "text": "♪ Happy Birthday, dear CatRat ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 540,
    "text": "♪ We're making sure"
  },
  {
    "index": 541,
    "text": "That your day is all that it can be ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 542,
    "text": "[melody plays]"
  },
  {
    "index": 543,
    "text": "♪ You'll see ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 544,
    "text": "-♪ Let me hear you say hey! ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 545,
    "text": "-♪ Hey! ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 546,
    "text": "-♪ Ho! ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 547,
    "text": "-♪ Ho! ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 548,
    "text": "-♪ Who's the raddest cat you know? ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 549,
    "text": "-♪ CatRat! ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 550,
    "text": "-♪ Hey! ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 551,
    "text": "-♪ Hey! ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 552,
    "text": "-♪ Ho! ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 553,
    "text": "-♪ Ho! ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 554,
    "text": "♪ It's the one and only CatRat, yo! ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 555,
    "text": "♪ Happy Birthday, dear CatRat ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 556,
    "text": "♪ We're making sure"
  },
  {
    "index": 557,
    "text": "That your day is all that it can be ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 558,
    "text": "[party horns honk]"
  },
  {
    "index": 559,
    "text": "♪ You'll see ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 560,
    "text": "[all] Happy Birthday, CatRat!"
  },
  {
    "index": 561,
    "text": "There's one more gift"
  },
  {
    "index": 562,
    "text": "for you to open, CatRat."
  },
  {
    "index": 563,
    "text": "Yeah! Open it up."
  },
  {
    "index": 564,
    "text": "I can't wait to see what's inside."
  },
  {
    "index": 565,
    "text": "Oh, this? It's empty. [chuckles]"
  },
  {
    "index": 566,
    "text": "I sent it myself to make sure"
  },
  {
    "index": 567,
    "text": "you didn't forget my birthday."
  },
  {
    "index": 568,
    "text": "Besides, with all of you"
  },
  {
    "index": 569,
    "text": "and the surprising-est"
  },
  {
    "index": 570,
    "text": "surprise party ever,"
  },
  {
    "index": 571,
    "text": "I already have the best gift in the world."
  },
  {
    "index": 572,
    "text": "-Aww!"
  },
  {
    "index": 573,
    "text": "-Birthday hug!"
  },
  {
    "index": 574,
    "text": "[all] We love you, CatRat."
  },
  {
    "index": 575,
    "text": "Aww! Thanks, guys."
  },
  {
    "index": 576,
    "text": "I think this is the best birthday ever."
  },
  {
    "index": 577,
    "text": "Aww!"
  },
  {
    "index": 578,
    "text": "Ready for one more surprise?"
  },
  {
    "index": 579,
    "text": "♪ Gabby Cat, Gabby Cat ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 580,
    "text": "♪ Gabby Cat, Gabby Cat ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 581,
    "text": "♪ Gabby Cat, Gabby Cat ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 582,
    "text": "♪ Gabby Cat, Gabby Cat ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 583,
    "text": "♪ Gabby Cat, Gabby Cat"
  },
  {
    "index": 584,
    "text": "Gabby Cat, Gabby Cat ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 585,
    "text": "♪ Gabby Cat of the Day! ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 586,
    "text": "It's me, of course."
  },
  {
    "index": 587,
    "text": "And this is my buddy CraftRat. [chuckles]"
  },
  {
    "index": 588,
    "text": "He's one part CatRat, two parts craft,"
  },
  {
    "index": 589,
    "text": "and three parts a-meow-zing!"
  },
  {
    "index": 590,
    "text": "-[Hamster Kitties inhale]"
  },
  {
    "index": 591,
    "text": "-[party horns honk]"
  },
  {
    "index": 592,
    "text": "Right!"
  },
  {
    "index": 593,
    "text": "And today, I'm gonna teach you"
  },
  {
    "index": 594,
    "text": "how to make a CraftRat of your very own."
  },
  {
    "index": 595,
    "text": "So, you're gonna need a craft stick,"
  },
  {
    "index": 596,
    "text": "a rectangular piece of paper,"
  },
  {
    "index": 597,
    "text": "two foam triangles,"
  },
  {
    "index": 598,
    "text": "a little white paint..."
  },
  {
    "index": 599,
    "text": "-...two buttons..."
  },
  {
    "index": 600,
    "text": "-[Hamster Kitty squeaks]"
  },
  {
    "index": 601,
    "text": "-...a little pink triangle for the nose..."
  },
  {
    "index": 602,
    "text": "-[Hamster Kitty squeaks]"
  },
  {
    "index": 603,
    "text": "...some pipe cleaners..."
  },
  {
    "index": 604,
    "text": "Oh!"
  },
  {
    "index": 605,
    "text": "...and a marker."
  },
  {
    "index": 606,
    "text": "I know, I know, it's a long list."
  },
  {
    "index": 607,
    "text": "-But trust me, it's gonna be worth it."
  },
  {
    "index": 608,
    "text": "-[Hamster Kitties giggle]"
  },
  {
    "index": 609,
    "text": "We're gonna need some glue"
  },
  {
    "index": 610,
    "text": "and some tape."
  },
  {
    "index": 611,
    "text": "Let's start with the face."
  },
  {
    "index": 612,
    "text": "CatRat blue, of course."
  },
  {
    "index": 613,
    "text": "And tape the foam triangles"
  },
  {
    "index": 614,
    "text": "to the top to make his ears."
  },
  {
    "index": 615,
    "text": "To make his eyes,"
  },
  {
    "index": 616,
    "text": "paint on two semicircles."
  },
  {
    "index": 617,
    "text": "And then..."
  },
  {
    "index": 618,
    "text": "add the buttons."
  },
  {
    "index": 619,
    "text": "Two little pipe cleaners for the eyebrows."
  },
  {
    "index": 620,
    "text": "-[Hamster Kitty squeaks]"
  },
  {
    "index": 621,
    "text": "-A triangle nose."
  },
  {
    "index": 622,
    "text": "Then draw a nice big CraftRat smile."
  },
  {
    "index": 623,
    "text": "Now, glue your handsome CraftRat head"
  },
  {
    "index": 624,
    "text": "to his crafty craft-stick body."
  },
  {
    "index": 625,
    "text": "Whoa-ho-ho!"
  },
  {
    "index": 626,
    "text": "Is CraftRat looking good, or what?"
  },
  {
    "index": 627,
    "text": "But we're not done yet."
  },
  {
    "index": 628,
    "text": "Two long pipe cleaners for the arms."
  },
  {
    "index": 629,
    "text": "Twist those on."
  },
  {
    "index": 630,
    "text": "And two more pipe cleaners for the legs."
  },
  {
    "index": 631,
    "text": "But don't forget the tape tail."
  },
  {
    "index": 632,
    "text": "It's the most important part."
  },
  {
    "index": 633,
    "text": "Put these through your tape roll first."
  },
  {
    "index": 634,
    "text": "Then twist them around the stick"
  },
  {
    "index": 635,
    "text": "to make the legs."
  },
  {
    "index": 636,
    "text": "Hmm."
  },
  {
    "index": 637,
    "text": "Check out that tail."
  },
  {
    "index": 638,
    "text": "Ha-cha!"
  },
  {
    "index": 639,
    "text": "And there you have it,"
  },
  {
    "index": 640,
    "text": "your very own CraftRat."
  },
  {
    "index": 641,
    "text": "[party horns honk]"
  },
  {
    "index": 642,
    "text": "The perfect crafty companion"
  },
  {
    "index": 643,
    "text": "to take him on a walk,"
  },
  {
    "index": 644,
    "text": "or to dinner,"
  },
  {
    "index": 645,
    "text": "or to a family vacation."
  },
  {
    "index": 646,
    "text": "Just be sure to give him"
  },
  {
    "index": 647,
    "text": "a few hugs now and then."
  },
  {
    "index": 648,
    "text": "-[Hamster Kitties] Aww!"
  },
  {
    "index": 649,
    "text": "-Aww!"
  },
  {
    "index": 650,
    "text": "I think CatRat had a pretty cat-tastic"
  },
  {
    "index": 651,
    "text": "time at his birthday party, don't you?"
  },
  {
    "index": 652,
    "text": "[party horn honks]"
  },
  {
    "index": 653,
    "text": "Come back next time and we'll open up"
  },
  {
    "index": 654,
    "text": "another Dollhouse Surprise."
  },
  {
    "index": 655,
    "text": "[as CraftRat] A-toodley-doo!"
  },
  {
    "index": 656,
    "text": "Bye."
  }
]